# QS Service - HTTP 测试文件
# 全自动平台服务 API 测试

### 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
Accept: application/json

### 根路径
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

### 系统信息
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/info
Accept: application/json

### 系统健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/health
Accept: application/json

### 系统配置
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/config
Accept: application/json

###

# ===== 认证相关 =====

### 用户注册
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "full_name": "Test User"
}

### 用户登录
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

### 刷新Token
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "your-refresh-token-here"
}

###

# ===== 用户相关 =====

### 获取当前用户信息
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Accept: application/json

### 更新当前用户信息
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Updated Name",
  "email": "updated@example.com"
}

### 修改密码
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "old_password": "Test1234!",
  "new_password": "NewPass123!"
}

###

# ===== 任务相关 =====

### 获取任务列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Accept: application/json

### 按状态筛选任务
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Accept: application/json

### 按类型筛选任务
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks?task_type=one_time
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Accept: application/json

### 关键词搜索任务
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks?keyword=test
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Accept: application/json

### 创建一次性任务
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hello World Task",
  "description": "A simple test task",
  "task_type": "one_time",
  "priority": "medium",
  "command": "echo 'Hello World'",
  "timeout": 3600,
  "max_retries": 3
}

### 创建定时任务
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Daily Backup",
  "description": "Daily database backup task",
  "task_type": "scheduled",
  "priority": "high",
  "command": "python backup.py",
  "cron_expression": "0 2 * * *",
  "timeout": 7200,
  "max_retries": 2
}

### 获取任务详情
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Accept: application/json

### 更新任务
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Task Name",
  "priority": "high",
  "timeout": 7200
}

### 删除任务
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here

### 执行任务
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/1/execute
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "params": {
    "env": "production",
    "debug": false
  }
}

### 获取任务日志
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/1/logs?page=1&page_size=50
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Accept: application/json

### 获取任务统计
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/statistics
Authorization: Bearer your-access-token-here
Accept: application/json

###

# ===== Swagger/OpenAPI 文档 =====

### API 文档 (Swagger UI)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

### API 文档 (ReDoc)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/redoc

### OpenAPI JSON
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/openapi.json
